  could go out but it's nothing open so  it's nothing to do so  um i mean only only times i really leave  the house  is to work out  um  you know right now we're trying to stay  as uh healthy as possible  um well we're trying to stay on our  piece of cue  cues with you know having like  uh hand sanitizer um washing our hands  um  you know just everything in regards to  just  um staying healthy and uh just trying to  um you know ultimately survive you know  through this pandemic that we got going  on  and chases fans of the sport we're all  anxious to see football players on the  field again how anxious are you to get  on the field and start chasing  quarterbacks again yeah you know i'm  real anxious you know um you know just  coming out of college  um usually spring ball  would be we'll be here now um so that's  definitely a springboard you know you  get back on the field um  and uh you know you can get back to it a  little bit and you get back in the  feeling uh but you know now the next  level is no spring ball so  um i feel like you really have to take  uh you know off season workouts  um you know you got to turn them up  another notch and  uh you know that's what uh you know i've  been trying to do but right now i feel  real comfortable what i'm doing  and uh i feel  um  comfortable enough that um i'm gonna put  my best foot forward when that time  comes well we all know that you're going  to be able to do that one guy who's sold  on what you can do is urban meyer one of  your former coaches at ohio state he  recently said god put that guy together  he said i'm going to make one of the  best defensive ends to ever play college  football how do you react when you hear  your former coach praise you that way  oh man it's uh  you know as a young guy coming in him  standing on me you know it  didn't start like that there was a lot  of uh you know  um growing up i had to do  uh you know  just you know the freshman struck was  you know when you come in um you know  coa