ally easy one for  me  well i can see you got the awesome  multiplies t-shirt on i got one up at  the house you're you fill it out a  little bit better than i do  what are you going to be wearing on  draft night  okay so with my whole draft uh my draft  um if it was still in vegas gucci was  supposed to do my suit  um and it's actually  it's ready but it said in italy right  now  um so we're still going to see if we can  get that here um  but if not i'm gonna wear uh i'm gonna  wear clothes  um by a designer called john elliott  um  based out of california um  so  um i have uh you know i'm gonna have the  fits  um you know for for uh  for the draft so if my suit doesn't come  in and i just wear giant  well we look forward to seeing it and we  know it's going to happen early the  floor is two the ceiling is won his name  will be called within the first half  hour at the latest on thursday night  chase it's great seeing you we  appreciate everything you've done on the  football field we can't wait to see what  you do at the nfl level all the best  this week thank you i appreciate it  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

